CardDescriptionm = "When this card is flipped face-up, each Non-Dragon Adventurer takes 2 Damage. If an Adventurer is Defeated by this effect, it is shuffled back into its Guildmaster's deck instead. While this card is in play, Dragons gain 2 Buff Counters. When a Dragon is put into the Shroud Zone from anywhere, you may deal 2 damage to an Adventurer in play."
